{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00284",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.59,
      "end_seconds": 4.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Come in, come in. Pull the door closed behind you, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.69,
      "end_seconds": 9.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Thanks. Sorry, uh, I'm a little early."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.99,
      "end_seconds": 11.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Have you been waiting long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.05,
      "end_seconds": 15.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Only about ten minutes, no trouble."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.86,
      "end_seconds": 18.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "What seems to be the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.22,
      "end_seconds": 30.9,
      "duration_seconds": 11.68,
      "text": "Mainly I've been feeling worn out since the flu. That's why I came. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.23,
      "end_seconds": 32.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.53,
      "end_seconds": 36.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "It's been like this since this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.1,
      "end_seconds": 46.47,
      "duration_seconds": 9.37,
      "text": "Okay, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps. I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.37,
      "end_seconds": 65.68,
      "duration_seconds": 18.31,
      "text": "Walking far definitely sets it off. Maybe a four out of ten on a bad day. My family kept telling me to get it checked. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I've also had poor sleep. There was aching legs, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.98,
      "end_seconds": 70.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.48,
      "end_seconds": 72.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "No, uh, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.31,
      "end_seconds": 75.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "And chest pain, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.91,
      "end_seconds": 77.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "No. No chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.05,
      "end_seconds": 82.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Any swollen legs, rash, shortness of breath or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.88,
      "end_seconds": 84.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.42,
      "end_seconds": 90.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.81,
      "end_seconds": 96.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.06,
      "end_seconds": 100.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.21,
      "end_seconds": 104.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Yeah, my father was diabetic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.69,
      "end_seconds": 108.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.36,
      "end_seconds": 111.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.76,
      "end_seconds": 114.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.47,
      "end_seconds": 116.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.15,
      "end_seconds": 120.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.12,
      "end_seconds": 122.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.25,
      "end_seconds": 125.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.54,
      "end_seconds": 134.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "I'm on Seretide inhaler, twice a day for my asthma. Paracetamol. I take it 500 milligrams, maybe, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.93,
      "end_seconds": 138.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "So, is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.63,
      "end_seconds": 141.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.12,
      "end_seconds": 156.97,
      "duration_seconds": 13.85,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.49,
      "end_seconds": 159.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.65,
      "end_seconds": 162.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Right, how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.56,
      "end_seconds": 165.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "I stopped smoking about two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.22,
      "end_seconds": 170.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.46,
      "end_seconds": 173.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Oh, I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.48,
      "end_seconds": 179.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.96,
      "end_seconds": 182.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Asthma, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.86,
      "end_seconds": 201.35,
      "duration_seconds": 15.49,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known asthma. We'll keep that in mind today. I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.04,
      "end_seconds": 203.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.42,
      "end_seconds": 206.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.81,
      "end_seconds": 210.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Yes, eggs. I get a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.23,
      "end_seconds": 214.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Hold on, the screen's frozen for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.11,
      "end_seconds": 235.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Alright, back to you. Alright, did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.1,
      "end_seconds": 239.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.1,
      "end_seconds": 243.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.24,
      "end_seconds": 245.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.07,
      "end_seconds": 248.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.32,
      "end_seconds": 267.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Chest sounds clear all over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.83,
      "end_seconds": 278.97,
      "duration_seconds": 9.14,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.95,
      "end_seconds": 283.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.44,
      "end_seconds": 285.27,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.35,
      "end_seconds": 310.58,
      "duration_seconds": 13.23,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Putting it all together, it fits best with post-viral fatigue. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. Anaemia is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.08,
      "end_seconds": 316.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.28,
      "end_seconds": 332.65,
      "duration_seconds": 15.37,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now post-viral fatigue is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling worn out since the flu, since this morning, and no rash or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.55,
      "end_seconds": 334.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.48,
      "end_seconds": 337.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.17,
      "end_seconds": 338.92,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.8,
      "end_seconds": 358.57,
      "duration_seconds": 10.77,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. We should do blood tests for fatigue. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'm going to order a thyroid test, for fatigue."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.32,
      "end_seconds": 360.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.02,
      "end_seconds": 370.25,
      "duration_seconds": 9.23,
      "text": "Pace yourself, a little more activity each day but stop before you're wiped out. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.81,
      "end_seconds": 383.62,
      "duration_seconds": 12.81,
      "text": "Mm. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.31,
      "end_seconds": 385.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 387.28,
      "end_seconds": 392.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 393.91,
      "end_seconds": 395.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 396.42,
      "end_seconds": 405.47,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "Let's review you in a month. Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 409.07,
      "end_seconds": 413.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "So, I come back in a month. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 414.37,
      "end_seconds": 419.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. All right, I'll let you go. Any final questions first?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 420.52,
      "end_seconds": 424.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
}